# Ath12kWifi (the Linux ath12k/mac80211/cfg80211 stack) and the sources its
# tools/source-lock.json pins. The Linux tree is the kernel.org tarball rather
# than a git checkout: one 157 MB download with a published SHA256, where
# git.kernel.org resets the TLS handshake often enough to fail reruns. Only the
# paths the lock names are extracted from it.
ATH12K_URL=https://github.com/UniXNU/Ath12kWifi.git
ATH12K_SHA=28de7b91d7a880682b777e0e3564245a99dbc3f5
